                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "A clever puzzle game transforms simple directional controls into surprisingly challenging and rewarding gameplay. Guiding large groups through intricate obstacle courses requires planning, timing, and careful observation. Each completed level provides a satisfying sense of accomplishment, especially when solutions come from understanding mechanics rather than trial and error.\n\nLevel design steadily introduces new concepts, hazards, and environmental interactions that keep progression engaging. Difficulty increases at a comfortable pace, allowing time to learn new mechanics before more complex challenges appear. Later stages encourage creative thinking and efficient routing, making every success feel earned.\n\nA clean visual style, relaxing atmosphere, and well designed puzzles combine to create an enjoyable experience that remains accessible while offering meaningful challenge. Strong progression, thoughtful level layouts, and rewarding problem solving make every stage feel worthwhile. The result is a satisfying puzzle adventure that successfully balances simplicity, challenge, and replay value.",
